From 56c47c63505e3555077be6a0a67116b3f77e8992 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh Boyd <boydjd@jbip.net>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 13:58:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] hw/riscv/esp32s31: SPI1 flash commands, optional
 write-back

Model the MSPI controller's software port to the flash: user commands
(reads, RDID, RDSR, WREN/WRDI, erase, program) and the built-in write
enable, sector/block erase and page program.  Changes go to a whole-chip
image, the XIP window's copy and, with flash-writeback=on, the image
file.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0158d423kzUx8WWBMMEZ95NX
---
 hw/riscv/esp32s31.c | 227 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 226 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

